@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Listar categorías visibles (predefinidas + propias)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?page=1&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{googleLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Crear una categoría personalizada
# @name createCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{googleLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Gimnasio",
  "color": "#FF6600"
}

### Editarla
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{googleLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Deporte"
}

### Eliminarla
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{googleLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
